   Kooser, Kuno and Liu, Xiao-Ding and Asavei, Theodor and Neagu, Liviu and
   Molodtsov, Serguei and Ochiai, Kohei and Kanno, Manabu and Yamazaki,
   Kaoru and Owada, Shigeki and Ogawa, Kanade and Katayama, Tetsuo and
   Togashi, Tadashi and Tono, Kensuke and Yabashi, Makina and Ghosh, Aryya
   and Gokhberg, Kirill and Cederbaum, Lorenz S. and Kuleff, I, Alexander
